              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Esau ukazamilwa ni Jakobo kwa wundu ghwa jija irasimio orejipatireghe kwa ndee, ukaghora ngolonyi kwake, “Matuku ghemlilia aba ghalighisa; kawona ghasia, nicham'bwagha mwanidu Jakobo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.41",
